      18→| Test | Description | Expected Result |
      19→|------|-------------|-----------------|
      20→| `TestScoreIncrease` | Initial score should be 0 | PASS - score equals 0 |
      21→| `TestScoreIncreaseOnEatingFood` | Score should increase by 10 when eating food | PASS - score increases correctly |
      22→| `TestGameOverOnWallCollision` | Snake should trigger game over on wall collision | PASS - collision detected |
      23→| `TestNewGameInitialization` | New game should initialize all fields | PASS - score=0, gameOver=false, snake/food initialized |
      24→
      25→### 2.3 snake/internal/snake Package
      26→
      27→| Test | Description | Expected Result |
      28→|------|-------------|-----------------|
      29→| `TestSnakeMove` | Snake should move in set direction | PASS - head moves right correctly |
      30→| `TestSnakeGrow` | Snake should grow when eating food | PASS - body length increases by 1 |
      31→| `TestSnakeReverseDirection` | Reverse direction should be blocked | PASS - reverse detected, 90° turns allowed |
      32→| `TestSnakeWallCollision` | Wall collision should be detected | PASS - collision at x=0 moving left |
      33→| `TestSnakeOccupies` | Occupies() should check body positions | PASS - correct occupancy detection |
      34→| `TestSnakeSelfCollision` | Self-collision should be detected | PASS - overlapping body detected |
      35→
      36→## 3. Build & Static Analysis
      37→
      38→| Check | Command | Expected Result |
      39→|-------|---------|-----------------|
      40→| Build | `go build ./...` | PASS - no errors |
      41→| Vet | `go vet ./...` | PASS - no warnings |
      42→| Race Detection | `go test -race ./...` | PASS - no data races |
      43→
      44→## 4. Integration / E2E Scenarios
      45→
      46→### 4.1 E2E Screenshot Script Validation
      47→
      48→| Check | Description | Expected Result |
      49→|-------|-------------|-----------------|
      50→| `e2e-screenshot.sh` exists | Script file should exist in `snake/scripts/` | PASS - file exists and is executable |
      51→| `asciinema.sh` exists | Alternative script should exist | PASS - file exists and is executable |
